  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Integrating Process Automation with the Power Automate Connector",
    "splashDescription": "The Power Automate Connector is an integration solution that links Camunda's process orchestration capabilities with Microsoft's Power Automate platform tailored for Desktop Flows. By using the connector, organizations can automate their business processes whilst making use of the combined functionalities of Power Automate and Camunda.",
